## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Agent workspace -- local settings and git worktrees. Worktrees are embedded git repos and must never be
# committed; a shared .claude/settings.json stays trackable.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/

# Wiki working material -- the ingest drop-zone and the raw sources as last ingested. Local to whoever runs an
# ingest: bulky, sometimes third-party material we shouldn't redistribute, and superseded by the curated pages.
# The knowledge itself lives in documentation/wiki/pages/ and the provenance in documentation/wiki/log.md.
documentation/wiki/ingest/
documentation/wiki/sources/

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# SPA bundle copied in for local dev (ADR-0020)
# The image builds its own client stage and COPYs the result to /app/wwwroot, so this path exists only in a
# working tree -- a build artifact regenerated by every `npm run build`, which AGENTS.md says not to commit
# (gh#1088). Scoped to this project rather than a bare `wwwroot/`, which would silently swallow one a future
# project legitimately tracks.
src/MarqSpec.TradingCopilot.Api/wwwroot/

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Obsidian (local wiki-vault config)
.obsidian/
